  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_1
    value: <style=title><color=#ffd800><size=34>WILD</style></color></size>
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_PAYOUT_FORMAT
    value: '<b><size=24>5 <color=#ffd800>{2:CommaNumber}</color>

      4 <color=#ffd800>{1:CommaNumber}</color>

      3
      <color=#ffd800>{0:CommaNumber}</color></size></b>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_1
    value: 'Appears on all reels and substitutes for all symbols

      except         
      ,          and          .'
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_2
    value: <style=title><color=#ffd800><size=34>SCATTER</style></color></size>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_2
    value: '<b>3</b> or more <b>Scatters</b> anywhere on reels triggers

      <color=#ffd800><b>Wicked
      Free Games</b></color>.'
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_3
    value: <style=title><color=#ffd800><size=34>WICKED FREE GAMES</style></color></size>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_3
    value: "<size=18><b>3</b> or more <b>Scatters</b> anywhere on reels triggers
      <color=#ffd800><b>Wicked Free Games</b></color>.\n   - <b>3 Scatters</b> -
      <b>10 Free Games</b> \n   - <b>4 Scatters</b> - <b>15 Free Games</b> \n   -
      <b>5 Scatters</b> - <b>20 Free Games</b> \n\nRe-trigger is possible.\n\nDuring
      <b>Wicked Free Games</b>, all <b>Diamond Symbols</b>           turn to\n<b>Diamond
      Wild Symbol</b>          .\n\n          acts as <b>Diamond Symbol</b> and <b>Wild
      Symbol</b>.\n\n<b>5</b> or more           anywhere on reels triggers\n<color=#ffd800><b>Diamond
      Re-Spin Feature</b></color>."
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_4
    value: <style=title><color=#ffd800><size=34>DIAMOND RE-SPIN FEATURE</style></color></size>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_4
    value: "<size=24><b>5</b> or more <b>Diamond Symbols</b>          \nin <b>Base
      Game</b> OR <b>5</b> or more <b>Diamond\nWild Symbols</b>          in <b>Wicked
      Free Games</b>\ntriggers <color=#ffd800><b>Diamond Re-Spin Feature</b></color>.\n\n<b>Diamond
      Re-Spin Feature</b> awards \n<b>3 Re-Spins</b> and is not possible to retrigger.\n\nTriggering         
      and additional          get locked\nuntil there is no remaining re-spins.\n  
      - <b>Diamond Symbol</b> can appear on any spot,\n      even a spot where       
      already exists.\n   - Each locked <b>Diamond Symbol</b> displays\n      the
      number of times <b>Diamond Symbols</b>\n      have appeared on that spot:\n            
      ->       ->       \n\nOnce <b>Diamond Re-Spin Feature</b> ends,\ncalculate
      the sum of the numbers on all the locked\n<b>Diamond Symbols</b> on reels and
      award\n<b>Diamond Pay</b> as follows:\n   - <b>20</b> or more <b>Diamonds</b>
      - <b>Grand Jackpot</b>\n   - <b>19 Diamonds</b> - <b>Mega Jackpot</b>\n   -
      <b>18 Diamonds</b> - <b>Major Jackpot</b>\n   - <b>17 Diamonds</b> - <b>Minor
      Jackpot</b>\n   - <b>16 Diamonds</b> - <b>Mini Jackpot</b>\n   - <b>5-<b>15
      Diamonds</b> - <b>Coin Prize</b>"
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_LINES
    value: <style=title><color=#ffd800><size=34>LINES</style></color></size>
